# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/
*.import/
export/
*.exe
*.apk
*.pck
*.kate-swp

# Raw Meshy "image-to-3d-texture" exports that bundle their textures directly
# inside the .fbx instead of as separate files (unlike every other model in
# this project) — these two blow past GitHub's 100MB file limit (136MB/115MB)
# and aren't wired into the game yet (spider/desert rat are still unrigged).
# The matching texture PNGs next to them are small and untouched by this.
# Remove these two lines once the models are re-exported without embedded
# textures, or once Git LFS is set up for the project.
models/mobs/juvenile spider/Meshy_AI_juvenile_spider_monst_0916005348_image-to-3d-texture.fbx
models/mobs/desert scavenger/Meshy_AI_desert_rodent_monster_0916015343_image-to-3d-texture.fbx
